{
  "technical_and_design_decisions": [
    "Implementation will be written in Go, extending the existing Hyperledger Fabric channel configuration library (fabric-config).",
    "Protobuf-derived data structures (such as common.Config, FabricMSPConfig, Organization, and Policy) will be used directly or wrapped in domain helper structures.",
    "Policy addition/removal methods for Application, Orderer, and Consortium groups/orgs will follow consistent mutation patterns returning updated config representations.",
    "Certificate revocation (U8) will parse x509 certificates and validate the target certificate signature against the MSP's root/intermediate CA certificates before appending to the RevocationList attribute."
  ],
  "assumptions": [
    "Development is performed by a single software engineer familiar with Go and Hyperledger Fabric channel configuration structures.",
    "Existing fabric-config codebase, build scripts, linting tools, and CI pipeline are available and functional.",
    "Protobuf definitions for MSP and Channel configuration are already generated and stable in the codebase."
  ],
  "activities": [
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-1",
      "activity_name": "Requirements Analysis and Technical Design",
      "activity_description": "Analyze existing fabric-config API patterns and design public helper functions and data structures for U1 through U8.",
      "most_likely_effort": 4
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-2",
      "activity_name": "Implement Organization Retrieval API (U1)",
      "activity_description": "Implement helper functions to extract config.Organization from application, orderer, or consortium configurations within a channel configuration transaction.",
      "most_likely_effort": 5
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-3",
      "activity_name": "Implement Policy Management APIs (U2, U3, U4)",
      "activity_description": "Implement functions to add and remove policies for Application orgs/groups, Orderer orgs/groups, and Consortium orgs/groups.",
      "most_likely_effort": 9
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-4",
      "activity_name": "Implement Org Addition Helpers (U5, U6)",
      "activity_description": "Implement helper functions to add new Orderer and Application Organization definitions to a channel configuration transaction.",
      "most_likely_effort": 6
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-5",
      "activity_name": "Implement MSP Configuration Retrieval API (U7)",
      "activity_description": "Implement helper function to extract MSP configuration for a specified organization from channel configuration transactions.",
      "most_likely_effort": 4
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-6",
      "activity_name": "Implement Certificate Revocation API (U8)",
      "activity_description": "Implement certificate revocation helper that validates x509 cert issuance against MSP CA certs and updates FabricMSPConfig revocation_list, returning errors for unissued certificates.",
      "most_likely_effort": 7
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-7",
      "activity_name": "Example Tests & Unit Test Suite Updates",
      "activity_description": "Create and update example tests (`example_test.go`) and comprehensive unit tests for all new helper functions demonstrating usage for U1-U8.",
      "most_likely_effort": 8
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "ACT-8",
      "activity_name": "Documentation and Self-Review",
      "activity_description": "Add Godoc comments for all exported APIs, format code, run linter, and perform final code self-review.",
      "most_likely_effort": 3
    }
  ],
  "reported_total": {
    "most_likely_effort": 46
  }
}
```

